  "title": "osf review: multi-agent PR review pipeline",
  "summary": "Adds a whole review subsystem to osf: a lens catalogue (20 shipped lenses plus repository overrides), a reviewer roster built from the `[agents]` table in `osf.toml`, per-reviewer headless runs in a clean copy of the change, quote verification of every finding against the real files, a deterministic reducer that turns answers into a verdict, and a GitHub Actions workflow that splits build, per-provider reviewer jobs, and a final reduce-and-post job. It also reworks suppression markers so a checker only judges markers it owns, and adds content-based risk signals that select lenses.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
